{
	"info": {
		"name": "QC Inspection — Pass/Fail",
		"description": "# QC Inspection — Pass/Fail\n\nBộ Postman Collection test manual cho usecase QC Inspector.\n\n## Activity Diagram — QC Inspection Flow\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      QC INSPECTION FLOW                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                               │\n                               ▼\n               ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n               │  1. View Pending Inspections │\n               │     GET /quality-inspections  │\n               └─────────────┬───────────────┘\n                             │\n                             ▼\n               ┌─────────────────────────────┐\n               │  2. Select Inspection Detail│\n               │     GET /quality-inspections │\n               │     /{id}                   │\n               └─────────────┬───────────────┘\n                             │\n                             ▼\n           ┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n           │  3. QC Inspector Decision           │\n           │  ┌───────────────────────────────┐  │\n           │  │  Pass                         │  │\n           │  │  POST /{id}/pass              │  │\n           │  │  Body: passedQuantity, note   │  │\n           │  │  → Stock: QI → AVAILABLE      │  │\n           │  │  → Movement: QC_RELEASE       │  │\n           │  └───────────┬───────────────────┘  │\n           │              │                       │\n           │  ┌───────────┴───────────────────┐  │\n           │  │  Fail                         │  │\n           │  │  POST /{id}/fail              │  │\n           │  │  Body: failedQuantity,        │  │\n           │  │  actionId, defectTypeId,      │  │\n           │  │  reason                       │  │\n           │  │                                │  │\n           │  │  Action → Result:              │  │\n           │  │  ┌──────┬──────────┬────────┐ │  │\n           │  │  │SCRAP │FAILED    │SCRAPPED│ │  │\n           │  │  ├──────┼──────────┼────────┤ │  │\n           │  │  │HOLD  │ON_HOLD   │ON_HOLD │ │  │\n           │  │  ├──────┼──────────┼────────┤ │  │\n           │  │  │REWORK│REWORK_REQ│(same)  │ │  │\n           │  │  └──────┴──────────┴────────┘ │  │\n           │  └───────────────────────────────┘  │\n           └─────────────────────────────────────┘\n                             │\n                             ▼\n           ┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n           │  4. Check Remaining                 │\n           │     ┌────────────────────────┐       │\n           │     │ remaining > 0 → PENDING │──────│──→ quay lại bước 3\n           │     │ remaining = 0 → TERMINAL│       │\n           │     └────────────────────────┘       │\n           │     Terminal statuses:               │\n           │     PASSED / FAILED / ON_HOLD /      │\n           │     REWORK_REQUIRED / SCRAPPED       │\n           └─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Cách dùng\n\n1. Bấm **\"Run\"** folder **\"🔐 0. Auth & Setup\"** trước để sinh JWT token\n2. Vào từng use case folder, bấm **\"Send\"** theo thứ tự từ trên xuống\n3. Các ID lookup (statuses, actions, defect-types) được tự động lưu vào biến\n\n## Yêu cầu\n- App đang chạy tại `localhost:8080`\n- Database đã seed data (docker-compose up + ./mvnw spring-boot:run)\n- Không cần copy-paste JWT hay ID — mọi thứ tự động",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_postman_id": "qc-inspection-pass-fail-collection"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{jwtToken}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🔐 0. Auth & Setup",
			"description": "Sinh JWT token và cache lookup IDs vào biến môi trường. Chạy folder này TRƯỚC khi test các use case khác.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "[0A] Generate JWT Token",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Generate JWT with HMAC-SHA256 using known secret",
									"const secret = pm.collectionVariables.get('jwtSecret') || 'k8wT5KF1ZrFojvpXJbhXOcYVv44lCKvOwQudCRY6HjxxTGH3WQbQDHEFZjhS+mCE';",
									"",
									"function base64url(source) {",
									"    return CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(source)",
									"        .replace(/=/g, '').replace(/\\+/g, '-').replace(/\\//g, '_');",
									"}",
									"",
									"const header = { alg: 'HS256', typ: 'JWT' };",
									"const now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
									"const payload = {",
									"    sub: 'admin',",
									"    role: 'ADMIN',",
									"    iat: now,",
									"    exp: now + 3600",
									"};",
									"",
									"const headerB64 = base64url(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(JSON.stringify(header)));",
									"const payloadB64 = base64url(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(JSON.stringify(payload)));",
									"const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(headerB64 + '.' + payloadB64, secret);",
									"const signatureB64 = base64url(signature);",
									"",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('jwtToken', headerB64 + '.' + payloadB64 + '.' + signatureB64);",
									"console.log('JWT token generated successfully');"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/statuses",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["statuses"]
						},
						"description": "Sinh JWT token và kiểm tra kết nối tới API bằng cách gọi GET statuses."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "[0B] Cache Lookup IDs",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.success && json.data) {",
									"    const statuses = json.data;",
									"    statuses.forEach(s => {",
									"        const key = 'qcStatus_' + s.name;",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set(key, s.id);",
									"        console.log('Cached ' + key + ' = ' + s.id);",
									"    });",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('qcStatus_PENDING', ",
									"        statuses.find(s => s.name === 'PENDING_INSPECTION')?.id);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('qcStatus_PASSED', ",
									"        statuses.find(s => s.name === 'PASSED')?.id);",
									"}",
									"",
									"// Fetch actions",
									"pm.sendRequest({",
									"    url: pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl') + '/actions',",
									"    method: 'GET',",
									"    header: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + pm.collectionVariables.get('jwtToken') }",
									"}, (err, res) => {",
									"    if (err) return;",
									"    const data = res.json();",
									"    if (data.success && data.data) {",
									"        data.data.forEach(a => {",
									"            pm.collectionVariables.set('qcAction_' + a.name, a.id);",
									"            console.log('Cached qcAction_' + a.name + ' = ' + a.id);",
									"        });",
									"    }",
									"});",
									"",
									"// Fetch defect types",
									"pm.sendRequest({",
									"    url: pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl') + '/defect-types',",
									"    method: 'GET',",
									"    header: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + pm.collectionVariables.get('jwtToken') }",
									"}, (err, res) => {",
									"    if (err) return;",
									"    const data = res.json();",
									"    if (data.success && data.data) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('defectTypeId', data.data[0]?.id);",
									"        console.log('Cached defectTypeId = ' + data.data[0]?.id);",
									"    }",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/statuses",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["statuses"]
						},
						"description": "Cache QC status IDs, action IDs, defect type IDs vào collection variables."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "[0C] Create Test Inspection (100 units)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"if (json.success && json.data) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('inspectionId', json.data.id);",
									"    console.log('Created inspection: ' + json.data.id);",
									"} else {",
									"    console.log('Failed to create inspection:', json);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"workOrderId\": \"a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006\",\n    \"productId\": \"a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\",\n    \"lotId\": \"a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004\",\n    \"quantity\": 100,\n    \"qcStatusId\": \"{{qcStatus_PENDING}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"]
						},
						"description": "Tạo QC inspection với 100 units ở trạng thái PENDING_INSPECTION."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"auth": {
				"type": "bearer",
				"bearer": [
					{
						"key": "token",
						"value": "{{jwtToken}}",
						"type": "string"
					}
				]
			},
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "prerequest",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"// Auto-generate JWT if not exists",
							"if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('jwtToken')) {",
							"    const secret = pm.collectionVariables.get('jwtSecret');",
							"    function b64u(s) { return CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(s).replace(/=/g,'').replace(/\\+/g,'-').replace(/\\//g,'_'); }",
							"    const h = b64u(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(JSON.stringify({alg:'HS256',typ:'JWT'})));",
							"    const p = b64u(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(JSON.stringify({sub:'admin',role:'ADMIN',iat:Math.floor(Date.now()/1000),exp:Math.floor(Date.now()/1000)+3600})));",
							"    const s = b64u(CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(h+'.'+p, secret));",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set('jwtToken', h+'.'+p+'.'+s);",
							"}"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "✅ Use Case 1: Pass QC — Happy Path (Full Quantity)",
			"description": "QC Inspector pass full lô hàng 100 units → stock chuyển QUALITY_INSPECTION → AVAILABLE, tạo QC_RELEASE movement.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Kiểm tra inspection trước khi pass\n2. Pass full 100\n3. Xác nhận status = PASSED, remaining = 0\n4. Pass lại → báo lỗi (inspection already closed)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "[1A] GET inspection detail (before pass)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/{{inspectionId}}",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["{{inspectionId}}"]
						},
						"description": "Xem chi tiết inspection trước khi pass: remainingQuantity = 100, qcStatusName = PENDING_INSPECTION"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "[1B] POST pass 100 units (full)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.test('Pass succeeds', () => {",
									"    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
									"    pm.expect(json.data.qcStatusName).to.eql('PASSED');",
									"    pm.expect(json.data.resultId).to.not.be.empty;",
									"    pm.expect(json.data.stockMovementId).to.not.be.empty;",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"passedQuantity\": 100,\n    \"note\": \"All dimensions within tolerance\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/{{inspectionId}}/pass",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["{{inspectionId}}", "pass"]
						},
						"description": "Pass full 100 units → status chuyển PASSED (terminal), stock QUALITY_INSPECTION → AVAILABLE, movement QC_RELEASE."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "[1C] GET detail (after pass — verify PASSED)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.test('Inspection is PASSED with 0 remaining', () => {",
									"    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
									"    pm.expect(json.data.qcStatusName).to.eql('PASSED');",
									"    pm.expect(Number(json.data.remainingQuantity)).to.eql(0);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/{{inspectionId}}",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["{{inspectionId}}"]
						},
						"description": "Verify: remainingQuantity = 0, qcStatusName = PASSED."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "[1D] POST pass again → 400 (already closed)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.test('Rejected with INVALID_INPUT', () => {",
									"    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.false;",
									"    pm.expect(json.errorCode).to.eql('INVALID_INPUT');",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"passedQuantity\": 5\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/{{inspectionId}}/pass",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["{{inspectionId}}", "pass"]
						},
						"description": "Edge case: pass khi inspection đã fully processed → 400 INVALID_INPUT."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
